n42155.content:
\begin{definition}
    \label{MyRat.le}
    \lean{MyRat.le}
    \uses{MyRat.IsNonneg, MyRat.field}
    \leanok
Let $x$ and $y$ in $\mathrm{MyRat}$. We write $x \leq y$ if $y - x$ is nonnegative.
